+  - https://github.com/istio/istio/issues/61403","+releaseNotes:","+  - |","+    **Added** support for `ClientTLSSettings.caCertCredentialName` in","+    `DestinationRule`, allowing the Secret or ConfigMap containing the server","+    trust bundle to be configured independently from the client identity in","+    `credentialName`. The field applies to gateways and to sidecars selected by","+    the `DestinationRule`'s `workloadSelector`; other sidecars continue to use","+    the configured certificate paths. Applies to `SIMPLE` and `MUTUAL` TLS","+    modes.",""],"additions":14,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":468,"deletions":28,"truncated":false,"file_count":7},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:19:54.114995+00:00"}